{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Like a תועפת.</b> A form of doubling, like מגילה עפה — meaning, doubled and redoubled; his strength is double the strength of a ראם. There is no likeness or comparison to his strength, so Scripture seized for him the ראם, because it is a large creature, in order to explain to the world according to their understanding."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:27.328315303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}